{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "5775ff2f786543ce79c82a4ce0e1e36a958050fa75c2e08c3600e82818cd14ba", "ja": "おまかせChu→LEADER", "zh": "托付Chu→LEADER", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "48a42e3db1a7e793d19998b25bc6d1a5c87a13954a22222bc7b81d8e3c3588c1", "ja": "地方公演のリーダーにと、プロデューサーは\n杏奈を指名。自信が持てない杏奈は、百合子\nと一緒ならやれるかもと条件を出す。しり込\nみする百合子だったが、カワイイ新曲を聞い\nてその気になってしまうのだった。", "zh": "制作人指名杏奈当地方公演的队长。\n没有自信的杏奈开出条件说，\n若是跟百合子一起担任或许办得到。\n百合子虽然有点却步，\n但听过可爱的新歌之后，便萌生尝试的意愿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "410e4731556242baeec2a237fd0082a8860f218a78d5aa40604bf02609ac8376", "ja": "（地方公演に向けて、これから頑張っていこう！\nさて、まずは最初に……）", "zh": "（现在开始努力准备地方公演吧！\n好，首先是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "1ebf2d36f2458a67fab14c7242e6ef71694860dd59d9da99435a60dfaa748dd2", "ja": "昨日のことを思い出すと今でも手が震えそう……。\n炎狼ヘルフレイムの極大攻撃、すごい威力だったね！", "zh": "我一想起昨天那一战，感觉现在手都会抖……\n炎狼地狱火的大招，威力真的超强的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "dc19b59e01a763ab1aa87769428b30bba92a3d580e9dd0825f0352a86d4645fc", "ja": "ん……でも、百合子さんが、回避バフ、\nかけてくれてたから……怖く、なかった……。", "zh": "嗯……不过，因为有百合子，帮杏奈上回避Buff……\n杏奈……一点都不怕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "351da9fbdcc697ef5d08a336cbb1d023bf02f849dfddd41c6441b8b5b7148717", "ja": "杏奈、百合子、お疲れさま。\nゲームの話か？", "zh": "杏奈、百合子，你们辛苦了。\n在聊电玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "d464fb0c1b4b2fcb9eee4dc9cf5d85a1d73f7ce7f9b1f8db369ed3077d4ff5b8", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　杏奈ちゃん、\nすごいんですよ。昨日も一人でボスを倒しちゃって！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n小杏很厉害喔。昨天也是，她一个人就打倒Boss了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "0cd6017d8509a7e6aa290a953bdd122bd11146aab4ce36acc85a58e941be6a4d", "ja": "一人じゃ、ない……です。\n杏奈たち、パーティだから……。", "zh": "杏奈，不是……一个人。\n因为杏奈我们，是一个队伍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "fe6a802bb72ff26133861f5275a6840d96a7a1ce7c9f13fff62811fc1b4b9751", "ja": "なるほど。……やっぱり適任かな。\n実は、そんな杏奈に話があって来たんだ。", "zh": "原来如此……杏奈果然很适合这个位置吧。\n其实我有事想跟你说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "caf8c5779d9432cb8f9d8bc170441d2fbec618660184414cbd7ea3b6d06d1e34", "ja": "今度、地方公演を行うことになったんだけど……。", "zh": "我们决定要举办地方公演了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "29ce80371ba6d9ec9aeb19854a5fc412a9a197e92efc2e0c495316dd452586d3", "ja": "杏奈に公演のリーダーを任せたいと思っている。\nどうかな？", "zh": "我想请杏奈你担任公演的队长。\n你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c3fea00fd5c8ace9559be5492af1226bdcfae87037311bc7aecca27b5f44bf04", "ja": "杏奈は大人しいけど、実は周りをよく見ているし、\nなんだかんだいって度胸もある。", "zh": "你虽然文静，其实一直都很仔细在观察周遭，\n而且也很有胆量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f5de382c44f0bec722e2a2ca003a75f47d33b2d17b6c1133757597288fcc2229", "ja": "ステージではみんなを引っ張る元気もあるし、\nきっといいリーダーになると思ったんだ。", "zh": "你还拥有在舞台上带领大家的活力，\n我觉得你一定可以成为一个好队长的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "10199db6bb53b52f6eaa8733e1c0363980ce1e7134439337e5609e3a83c14289", "ja": "すごいすごい！　公演のリーダーだなんて、\nさすが勇者だね♪　おめでとう、杏奈ちゃん！", "zh": "好厉害好厉害！能被指名当公演的队长，\n真不愧是勇者呢♪恭喜你，小杏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "2fdb378a919ce38c8b6f4ab5ededa7b710334755bf6d46a2066dd4d924433559", "ja": "で、でも……、あの……。", "zh": "可、可是……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "d27236de7a41b291dc89c125179ae256f11cc951f2b5b22fff0448eee1661bd0", "ja": "やっぱり……。\n杏奈には無理……です。", "zh": "杏奈……\n真的……做不到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "9f6433ac75f2cbe0bda8c5315580e7ba5b2cd836b0c6af4bc9e6a6e07c2c1ce1", "ja": "ホントの杏奈は……すごく、ない……。\nレベルが足りない、から……。", "zh": "真正的杏奈……一点都，不厉害……\n因为……等级不够……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "909b26eab6af5d15c3f4bbcd047aa0bf9b9e39474704cb610a9079691fe0a36b", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん……。", "zh": "小杏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f8d5435ffb90427ff999bf02ae633472d665283e55ad92030cbe249f6cbf1dad", "ja": "うーん、そうか？　杏奈なら立派にできると思うし、\nいい経験にもなると思うんだけど……。", "zh": "唔──是吗？我觉得杏奈应该可以做得很好，\n而且也会是一个很好的经验……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "6617a0c059935e7636ac4affacb41ec9018a2a9eb975ae2a376257de84ed51ba", "ja": "…………。\nごめん……なさい……。", "zh": "…………\n对不……起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "2653b46db4d0de89647c57d1aedbae852eb4ba11f806bb607fd9c904f6181af8", "ja": "（すっかり尻込みしてしまっている。\nいきなり過ぎたかな……）", "zh": "（她完全裹足不前。\n是不是太突然了呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "95569bcc4a91c521bb34d7148cfaf4d05acaf26e1b0124cf8bfdf5d862d434e7", "ja": "いや、わかったよ。それならそれで大丈夫。\n杏奈のリーダーは、またの機会にしよう。", "zh": "嗯，我知道了，这样也没有关系。\n之后有机会再找杏奈当队长吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "2d7e1271fd28249b7293fc40e2532e717074edba981c7e6b75177af596ff0c69", "ja": "あ。あの……、待ってください。", "zh": "啊。不好意思……请等一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "5c96ffc6e357a85f6e5521d71ac228bb8119aa90daf4e917028f4cc27bf7da52", "ja": "あの……、あのね、杏奈ちゃん。私も杏奈ちゃんなら、\nリーダーにピッタリだって思うんだけどな。", "zh": "那个……听我说，小杏。\n其实我也觉得小杏很适合当队长喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1025_024ann", "source_sha256": "1f5aa064d98a658b043b509b08dfc6b5120ca7d843200f68291086f76459b5b6", "ja": "百合子さん……。", "zh": "百合子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "28390efe5765b989deec8c61b8a84738f5a24e0296cda76fe50f19c5f058840c", "ja": "だってゲームでは、あんなに決断力があって、指示も\n的確で、どんな敵にも立ち向かう勇気もあって！", "zh": "因为你在游戏中，是那么有决断力，指示也都很到位，\n还拥有面对任何敌人都能勇敢向前的勇气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1027_024ann", "source_sha256": "7faf83ecdffb9cb0644f9b4ff47bdfa381ac3b2d5597d1ddfcab2c4379636538", "ja": "あれは……ゲーム、だから……。", "zh": "因为那是……在游戏里面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "27c3e0f74b30730e116d843a024a228d8eefd6439ee537a8e17b6fec5ba766df", "ja": "でも、ゲームをしてるのは、杏奈ちゃん本人だもん。\n……私、杏奈ちゃんには、きっとあると思うの。", "zh": "可是，玩游戏的人就是小杏自己啊。\n……我觉得小杏身上一定有的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1029_026yur", "source_sha256": "1ed3cc16cf6d97a034a920ffcf7031f833c413629ef62dc449240063558ff9f5", "ja": "リーダーとしてのスキルっていうか……\n適正、みたいなの！", "zh": "有一种队长特有的技能……\n类似适合当队长的特质！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1031_024ann", "source_sha256": "d1f62afadf799b9615630b16a1548ef07bfd5b802ca4239e8db32f636b08f3b1", "ja": "……あの、{$P$}さん……。\n杏奈……できる、かも。", "zh": "……那个，{$P$}先生……\n杏奈……说不定，做得到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "3a2da1ba05edbffa3df2577fb4a645633cd6e087dbbf1a76f077f6e6d29764d9", "ja": "えっ？　リーダー、やってくれるのか？\nうれしいけど、本当にいいのか？", "zh": "咦？你愿意担任队长吗？\n我是很高兴啦，但是真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1033_024ann", "source_sha256": "f6393df8be7ee6471f5bcabdb8776208fd8c3256e34b814564006fbdbee4db4e", "ja": "ひとりでは、自信、ない……けど……\n百合子さんと、一緒なら……。", "zh": "虽然，自己一个人……没有自信……\n但如果，跟百合子一起的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1034_026yur", "source_sha256": "a9efaef7d1b65a013c0dacc7c03ed08cf38acf14370d47cd841d09e149527f25", "ja": "え？　……えええっ！？\nわ、私と一緒って、まさか……！？", "zh": "咦……咦咦咦！？\n跟我一起的意思是，难不成……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "d10f069560a1819d839ec6d9f3ea5623e89da755feb0799b2bbc8f224e2bf0a1", "ja": "なるほど、百合子と二人でリーダーってことか。\n面白そうだな！", "zh": "原来如此，你想跟百合子两个人一起担任队长啊。\n感觉很有趣呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1036_026yur", "source_sha256": "ac42f0625c9f0ea2e8a6e8d80443eda8c1287a1c050dfe5880cf0332527fed74", "ja": "やっぱり！？　ま、待って、ちょっと待ってください！\n杏奈ちゃんはともかく……！", "zh": "还真的！？啊，等等，请等一下！\n先不说小杏……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1037_026yur", "source_sha256": "55913f276b316eaf4bd4b73cb61e11e0526c4152b26afeedc60c7aaec4a7362b", "ja": "私はリーダーなんて、向いてませんよ！？\n人見知りだし、たまにネガティブになりますし……！", "zh": "我完全不适合当队长耶！？\n我既怕生，有时候又很悲观……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1038_024ann", "source_sha256": "b6f17599cc38b77e7afb3badd9aaf23f7e74fb32204c90e6b886c06fcd94a0ab", "ja": "でも……ゲームだと、元気だから……\n平気だと、思います。", "zh": "可是……你在游戏里，很有活力……\n杏奈觉得，没有问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "eb04f213e9b914fddc7155b70e9635d35af5d0af051e9bb31d753b32706b6d5f", "ja": "そうか。ゲームをしているのは百合子本人だし、\nバッチリだな！", "zh": "原来是这样，毕竟玩游戏的也是百合子本人嘛，\n完全没问题呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1040_026yur", "source_sha256": "f025fcc163ff3fb92df3c6c0de3b9be3856f2b2c03800cba917b4f2fc6314a3c", "ja": "ひいいっ、そんなブーメランを返すだなんて！\n{$P$}さんのいじわる！　ドS！", "zh": "噫～～竟然拿我说过的话来亏我！\n{$P$}先生也太坏心眼了！虐待狂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1041_p", "source_sha256": "b46faf29d3e36adfd494e9d9cbc6f319dc3b5f91f5c6f21e17a168ca6841a15f", "ja": "いや、別にいじめてるわけじゃないぞ？", "zh": "不，我没有要欺负你的意思喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1042_024ann", "source_sha256": "4e8f3a40608fc5e4e98675d327bc0a7d1f5b3f49bebd2d548c20635d2a9bfbe7", "ja": "百合子さんがいてくれたら、杏奈……\nどんなクエストでも、攻略できそう……です。", "zh": "杏奈觉得，只要有百合子在……\n无论是什么样的任务……杏奈都能破关。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1043_026yur", "source_sha256": "909b26eab6af5d15c3f4bbcd047aa0bf9b9e39474704cb610a9079691fe0a36b", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん……。", "zh": "小杏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1044_p", "source_sha256": "8d7652c0a324575cc61f73aeb344fd6eb9dde3545c435d451065e4b39f86dc1e", "ja": "まあ、どのみち二人には、デュエットで新曲を\n歌ってもらおうと思ってたんだ。", "zh": "反正，其实我从一开始，\n就想让你们两人合唱新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1045_026yur", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1046_p", "source_sha256": "4055441bea79c4b236aa45b3d878493890a6104befc183188b4042e8d6e94b5d", "ja": "これなんだけど。ま、聞いてみてくれ。", "zh": "是这首歌。总之，你们就先听听看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1048_026yur", "source_sha256": "819d3b200cd39089be9700d03b2f9f0d43b001a0f5b2f5c84b1c42bb14c089a3", "ja": "わあ……、かわいい曲……！", "zh": "哇啊……好可爱的歌曲……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1049_024ann", "source_sha256": "51d1d9793109470c2ee8af68f4a6f75a06cf527d0cc1276f492dbd92a37b0f9a", "ja": "この曲を、百合子さんと……♪", "zh": "跟百合子……一起唱这首歌……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1050_p", "source_sha256": "36369d565830603f086c42d370d76455eda7162ef783c6352f57c268414ad7bc", "ja": "二人で力を合わせて、この曲を歌うつもりで、\nリーダーも二人で……。どうかな？", "zh": "你们两个就一起唱这首歌，\n也协力担任队长……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1051_026yur", "source_sha256": "3c50e4d3784b0e66f1145a6ebe65305b91dc27bd9b84f246777a453cea9fc979", "ja": "うう……。わ、わかりましたっ！\n私、やります……。杏奈ちゃんとリーダーやります！", "zh": "唔……我、我知道了！\n我愿意参与……跟小杏一起当队长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1052_024ann", "source_sha256": "d99459fe2910242c2d30916960d1fce8b5b00026ca11da98083dbc9704a92e98", "ja": "百合子さん……！", "zh": "百合子……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1053_026yur", "source_sha256": "cbc3aa12a54e228db81b059a8200005a545b03bf70e11682cd6d580042c3dfa2", "ja": "も、もう……そんな嬉しそうな顔するなんて。\nずるいよ、杏奈ちゃん。", "zh": "真、真是的……你怎么露出这么开心的表情。\n太犯规了啦，小杏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1054_024ann", "source_sha256": "aa96e89201b58a4e7b5437636d3943b16b58ed37b56ff68ea91f59c98b3429d7", "ja": "えへへ……。\n一緒に、頑張ろう……ね♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……\n一起加油……吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1055_p", "source_sha256": "220222f46f147cdf881c9e42f3aa922edefc93328fd0fee6ad392ae0ac13a0b2", "ja": "決まりだな！\nそれじゃあ、あらためて……杏奈、百合子。", "zh": "那就这么决定了！\n那么，再说一次……杏奈、百合子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_01_1056_p", "source_sha256": "1d68c5be787232ee09caae36c7f2802541e3b213c1de4e64aed44a4797abd8bf", "ja": "今度の地方公演のリーダー、任せたぞ。\nみんなと一緒に、頑張ろう！", "zh": "这次地方公演的队长一职就交给你们了。\n跟大家一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
